    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. can you go deeper into those early years though? specifically the period leading up to the 1954 outbreak. i really want to capture the sense of why the colonial system was so fundamentally broken for them and why armed struggle became the only viable option. maybe you can highlight the specific injustices that drove the FLN to take action?",
