      "content": "yeah exactly. it's sounding like a pretty clear-cut case of an oppressive system vs a people fighting for survival. when i'm writing the scenes where the French military is responding to the FLN, is there any way to frame their actions or justifications that isn't just portraying them as the villains? or was the colonial administration's position basically indefensible given the circumstances you described?",
